      "archaeologicalRemains": "traces",
      "details": "<p>The temple's construction was abandoned in 506 BC when Lygdamis was overthrown. The temple is thought to have been converted into a church around the 5th century AD. The entrance was too heavy to be removed during later spoliation, and thus now stands alone as the Portara.</p>",
